# Keep the php image build context small. On a server, backups/ and sideload/
# can hold gigabytes that would otherwise be sent to the daemon on every build.
.git
.github
backups
sideload
docs
README.md

# Never ship secrets into the build context (they could otherwise be sent to
# the Docker daemon / a remote builder or baked into a layer). Keep the example.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.key
*.pem
